    "formal": "\\varphi(n) \\equiv 2 \\pmod 4 \\iff v_2(\\varphi(n)) = 1,",
    "plain": "Euler's totient $\\varphi(n)$ is even for all $n>2$ (parent oq-06). We now ask a finer question:",
